    "Native modifier/FSM/SP dispatch, numeric selector aliases, accepted-output ordering, source-owned ASPD and sampled burst cooldowns use the documented local contracts, not compiled Unity/frame parity.",
    "S1 retains one attack account and Bind-before-Arts ordering. S3 injury clocks follow selected first/interval timing and owned parent cleanup; native callback ordering remains unverified.",
